Riftway CEF patch 0007: CefBrowserProcessHandler::OnChildProcessGone.

Reports the browser child processes that are not renderers (GPU, utility,
zygote and the rest) when they crash, are killed or fail to launch, as
Electron's App does for child-process-gone through
content::BrowserChildProcessObserver (BrowserChildProcessCrashed, Killed and
LaunchFailed): the process type's English name
(content::GetProcessTypeNameInEnglish), the termination status, the exit code,
the metrics (service) name, the display name and, for a failed launch on
Windows, the system error code. CefContext owns the observer from context
initialisation to shutdown. API at CEF_NEXT (999998): API version 15400 and
its hash are unchanged.

Resolves: Riftway docs/DRIFT.md A31.
Base: CEF a03e714 (branch 8037, CEF 154) with 0001-0006. Applies in chromium/src/cef.

